    "explain": "$6x e^(3x^2 + 1) + 2x$"
   },
   {
    "id": "L4",
    "type": "mc",
    "text": "Other bases pick up a natural log: $frac{d}{dx} b^x = b^x ln(b)$. What is $frac{d}{dx} 2^x$?",
